  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Harmeet Singh vs Food Safety And Standards Authority Of ... on 26 November, 2025 Author: Sachin Datta Bench: Sachin Datta $~91 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(C) 17909/2025 Harmeet Singh Through: Pe versus Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India & Ors. .....",
    "facts": "The present petition has been filed by the petitioner being aggrieved by the fact a food product ordered by him through an e-commerce platform, was found to contain a visible fungal contamination. The petitioner submits that despite promptly informing the platform and raising complaints before the concerned Food Safety Authorities, no effective action has been taken. Hence the present petition has been filed.",
